  <name>Hearts</name>
  <summary>Play the classic card game Hearts</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Hearts is a classic trick-taking card game for four players. Avoid winning
      tricks that contain hearts or the Queen of Spades to keep your score low —
      or take every penalty card in a single round to shoot the moon.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Play offline against three computer opponents</li>
      <li>Optional online multiplayer</li>
      <li>Configurable rules and gameplay variants</li>
      <li>Undo, autosave, and adjustable animation speed</li>
      <li>Multiple card decks and table backgrounds</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
